=== Count n ≤ N with n^2+1 prime ===
N=  10: 5 primes
N=  50: 12 primes
N= 100: 19 primes
N= 200: 34 primes

=== Prime factors of n^2+1 ===
n= 1: 2 factors=2
n= 2: 5 factors=5
n= 3: 10 factors=2 5
n= 4: 17 factors=17
n= 5: 26 factors=2 13
n= 6: 37 factors=37
n= 7: 50 factors=2 5 5
n= 8: 65 factors=5 13
n= 9: 82 factors=2 41
n=10: 101 factors=101

=== Sum of n where n^2+1 is squarefree ===
N= 10: 48
N= 30: 440
N= 50: 1096

